id: darkness-mixer
name: Darkness Mixer
type: modifier
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
usageLimit: 1/round
baseManeuver: power-up
# Villainous Form (2)'s, open while it applies, offered on the Power Up (use-maneuver.mjs modifiersFor).
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  3(bT) Evil Points and Ki Points back, then a Might Clash at every Opponent within a Sphere AoE: won, they lose 1/2 of your Might.
text: >
  Darkness Mixer [1/Round]: A wash of dark power fills you with unimaginable strength.
  –Maneuver Type: Modifier Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Base Maneuver: Power Up Maneuver
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Effect: Regain 3(bT) Evil Points and Ki Points. Then, make a Might Clash against all Opponents within a Sphere AoE (centered on you). If you win against an Opponent, reduce the Life Points of that Opponent by 1/2 of your Might.

---

# The Evil Points and Ki, then a Might Clash at each Opponent within a Standard Sphere (chat.mjs areaClash).
[on used]
evilpoints.stacks += 3(bT);
ki.value += 3(bT);
areaClash(might, standard, halfMight);
